    "High-caliber physicians rarely browse job boards. Personalized, respectful outbound outreach is the only reliable way to initiate conversations with top practitioners.": "Topartsen bezoeken zelden vacaturesites. Gepersonaliseerde, respectvolle outbound outreach is de enige betrouwbare manier om met hen in contact te komen.",
